## Synthetic. Same asset transition as hls-media-asset-transition.m3u8, but
## the packager publishes a single playlist-level #EXT-X-PROGRAM-DATE-TIME.
## One tag is enough to anchor the whole window: it formally timestamps the
## segment that follows it, and every later segment is reached by
## accumulating #EXTINF from there.
##
## The PDT deliberately does NOT agree with any plausible "now" — the window
## ends at 13:59:54Z, so a test passing a later nowMs proves the timeline is
## read from the tag rather than from the live edge.
#EXTM3U
#EXT-X-TARGETDURATION:7
#EXT-X-VERSION:3
#EXT-X-MEDIA-SEQUENCE:661300
#EXT-X-PROGRAM-DATE-TIME:2026-09-10T13:59:24.000Z
#EXTINF:6.000,
https://live-content.xumo.com/3845/content/XM08RIB78GYPVR/28846714/6_100.ts
#EXTINF:6.000,
https://live-content.xumo.com/3845/content/XM08RIB78GYPVR/28846714/6_101.ts
#EXTINF:6.000,
https://live-content-cf.xumo.com/149/content/XM05M7E0PC09SI/28980908/6_001.ts
#EXTINF:6.000,
https://live-content-cf.xumo.com/149/content/XM05M7E0PC09SI/28980908/6_002.ts
#EXTINF:6.000,
https://live-content-cf.xumo.com/149/content/XM05M7E0PC09SI/28980908/6_003.ts
